&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/uZE_89I9H39mTVEpI8h14RSD1GFChK1JlE7g_g2S40B4ponDNKiIlFuClwBUcixe9Qm_555Ye9ZkDJZM2MIFcPf-_IKIU3FhIpdEzvAO5PxklVDqbovCdqmAQd2SEG7u78bsUjM3d9YYi9NHRI9PLZeuSQaeIk8F1FAI-3p9UagSIEYrjlTbGzJnsLMcRrL0ibD2W8rshW7eKj2uGUrZX-VaO1yK9DMJ8yjXjf9cXl6LnVpvuNd7wrT1vYdxlV1fxVjvhVH9g4w1c5vJsAv0v5W5uA44s825JqecID4hawv38UsWxNhYkbD9V4R2BRwhlGBO-bcQvpZfW52eQmxVzQ.jpg" alt="Telegram post image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
